{"term": {"label": "智", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-ii", "title": "梁惠王下", "description": "莊暴見孟子，曰：「暴見於王，王語暴以好樂，暴未有以對也。」曰：「好樂何如？」\n孟子曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊國其庶幾乎！」\n他日，見於王曰：「王嘗語莊子以好樂，有諸？」王變乎色，曰：「寡人非能好先王之樂也，直好世俗之樂耳。」\n曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊其庶幾乎！今之樂猶古之樂也。」曰：「可得聞與？」\n曰：「獨樂樂，與人樂樂，孰", "occurrences": 1, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "免", "id": "免"}, {"form": "勇", "id": "勇"}, {"form": "問", "id": "問"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "大王", "id": "大王"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "小", "id": "小"}, {"form": "怒", "id": "怒"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "畏", "id": "畏"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "請", "id": "請"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.456735772821304, "source": "天", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.8505999692509885, "source": "天", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.9459101490553132, "source": "天", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 3.044522437723423, "source": "天", "target": "畏"}, {"weight": 0.990398704027877, "source": "天", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 0.08961215868968714, "source": "天", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 3.709498741316672, "source": "智", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 3.1033629377463563, "source": "智", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 3.1986731175506815, "source": "智", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 0.7362393236147395, "source": "大", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.0047506490782467, "source": "大", "target": "問"}, {"weight": 1.231560760844765, "source": "大", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.921041380952402, "source": "大", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.3116034685183013, "source": "大", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.187072205872201, "source": "大", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 1.493925025312256, "source": "大", "target": "畏"}, {"weight": 1.717068576626466, "source": "大", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 1.717068576626466, "source": "大", "target": "請"}, {"weight": 3.1033629377463563, "source"